; Concrete source adaptation of FLT/Three.lean:458-565.
; Exact order witnesses construct all four lambda-free residual factors.
; The proved order balance cancels equal nonzero lambda powers and gives
; x*y*z=u*w^3. Neither the factors nor this equation are postulated.
; Pairwise coprimality and the later strict descent remain separate.
